{"verse_key": "10:102", "surah": 10, "verse": 102, "text_uthmani": "فَهَلْ يَنتَظِرُونَ إِلَّا مِثْلَ أَيَّامِ ٱلَّذِينَ خَلَوْا۟ مِن قَبْلِهِمْ ۚ قُلْ فَٱنتَظِرُوٓا۟ إِنِّى مَعَكُم مِّنَ ٱلْمُنتَظِرِينَ", "translation": "So do they wait except for like [what occurred in] the days of those who passed on before them? Say, \"Then wait; indeed, I am with you among those who wait.\"", "verse_from_ms": 2183530, "verse_to_ms": 2202780, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "فَهَلْ", "start_ms": 2183530, "end_ms": 2184260}, {"i": 1, "text": "يَنتَظِرُونَ", "start_ms": 2184260, "end_ms": 2186120}, {"i": 2, "text": "إِلَّا", "start_ms": 2186120, "end_ms": 2186790}, {"i": 3, "text": "مِثْلَ", "start_ms": 2186790, "end_ms": 2187350}, {"i": 4, "text": "أَيَّامِ", "start_ms": 2187350, "end_ms": 2188220}, {"i": 5, "text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 2188220, "end_ms": 2189240}, {"i": 6, "text": "خَلَوْا۟", "start_ms": 2189240, "end_ms": 2189910}, {"i": 7, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 2189910, "end_ms": 2190790}, {"i": 8, "text": "قَبْلِهِمْ", "start_ms": 2190790, "end_ms": 2192600}, {"i": 9, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 2192600, "end_ms": 2192880}, {"i": 10, "text": "قُلْ", "start_ms": 2192880, "end_ms": 2195869}, {"i": 11, "text": "فَٱنتَظِرُوٓا۟", "start_ms": 2195870, "end_ms": 2197190}, {"i": 12, "text": "إِنِّى", "start_ms": 2197190, "end_ms": 2198070}, {"i": 13, "text": "مَعَكُم", "start_ms": 2198070, "end_ms": 2198710}, {"i": 14, "text": "مِّنَ", "start_ms": 2198710, "end_ms": 2202385}, {"i": 15, "text": "ٱلْمُنتَظِرِينَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}